WEBVTT

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.110
Princess Lala!

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:10.690
Now that I think about it, you're Yuuki Rito's fiancée, aren't you?

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.200
Then to me, you're...

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:34.010
Master, thank you for everything up to now.

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:39.060
From now on, I'll choose my path for myself.

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:43.230
Mea...

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:13.340
<b>fushigi na yasuragi kanshou</b>

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:13.340
<b>不思議な安らぎ観賞</b>

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:13.340
<b>This strange feeling of peaceful enjoyment</b>

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:15.930
<b>shibaraku kono mama</b>

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:15.930
<b>しばらくこのまま</b>

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:15.930
<b>Will continue for a while</b>

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:20.510
<b>rikai funou puroburemubousou</b>

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:20.510
<b>理解不能プロブレム暴走</b>

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:20.510
<b>An impossible to solve problem runs wild</b>

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.810
<b>genin wa?</b>

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.810
<b>原因は？</b>

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.810
<b>And the cause is?</b>

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:30.270
<b>kimi to iru to kudaranai oshie wasureru</b>

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:30.270
<b>君といるとくだらない教え忘れる</b>

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:30.270
<b>Whenever I'm with you, I forget all about these boring lessons</b>

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:38.070
<b>kono henka kara umaretahonshin ukeireyou</b>

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:38.070
<b>この変化から生まれた本心受け入れよう</b>

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:38.070
<b>I want you to accept the true feelings born from this change</b>

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:42.030
<b>harimegutta saisho no kokoro</b>

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:42.030
<b>張り巡った最初の心</b>

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:42.030
<b>I reeled in the first heart I could hook</b>

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:45.500
<b>taguriyose sotto seebushita</b>

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:45.500
<b>手繰り寄せそっとセーブした</b>

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:45.500
<b>Carefully saving it</b>

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:50.130
<b>hyouteki ni fukuzatsu na mune no yami takushite</b>

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:50.130
<b>標的に複雑な胸の闇託して</b>

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:50.130
<b>I use the complicated darkness in my heart on my target</b>

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:53.210
<b>Care me! Care me! Care me! Care me!</b>

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:53.210
<b></b>

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:53.210
<b></b>

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:59.220
<b>naiteru kokoro atatamete yatto kizuita</b>

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:59.220
<b>泣いてる心温めてやっと気づいた</b>

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:59.220
<b>As I warmed the crying heart, I finally realised</b>

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:08.060
<b>watashi no himitsu heiki wa nani yori mo tsuyoku katakumusunda</b>

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:08.060
<b>私の秘密兵器はなによりも強く硬く結んだ</b>

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:08.060
<b>That more than anything, my secret weapon is strongly, firmly bound</b>

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:11.310
<b>kimi to no tsunagari</b>

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:11.310
<b>君との繋がり</b>

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:11.310
<b>With my connection to you</b>

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:23.080
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:23.080
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:23.080
<b>「Power and power</b>

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:23.080
<b>「Power and power</b>

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:23.080
<b>~Protector and the Protected~」</b>

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:23.080
<b>~Protector and the Protected~」</b>

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.920
Thank you, Murasame-senpai.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.760
Thanks to you, I got my body back.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.430
Mea-san!

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:47.430
Now I can scare you again, right Senpai?

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:48.640
Here!

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.310
Please stop that!

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:53.150
Good grief...

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:54.570
Mea!

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:56.280
Nana-chan!

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.160
I was a little worried.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:03.910
Sorry.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:05.160
Huh?

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:08.080
Why are you wearing my clothes, Nana-chan and Momo-chan?

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.080
Oh. Sorry, sorry.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.040
It was an emergency, so...

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.630
Not bad, Mea.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:20.880
I was surprised that you separated me from
yourself by co-operating with Murasame Shizu.

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:23.890
Eh... What's with her body?

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:25.890
Is this her true form?

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:30.390
As I thought, Nemesis is different from Yami-san and Mea-san!

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:32.140
But, why...?

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:36.150
I have a feeling I've seen that black aura somewhere before...

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:40.320
Momo! Over there, big sister is...!

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.110
Nemesis!

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.370
There are lots of things I want to ask you about, but...!

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:48.120
Please, feel free to.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:52.040
Oshizu-san, we're going to go help Onee-sama.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:55.840
Can you let Tearju-sensei and Mikado-sensei know?

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:58.300
U-Understood!

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.590
Are you going as well, Mea?

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:02.760
Of course!

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:05.720
I have to return Yami-oneechan to normal.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:08.510
I'm going even if you tell me to stop, Neme-chan.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.270
Mea! Hurry!

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:14.850
Neme-chan, huh?

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:17.770
Not bad.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.030
What is that...?

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.740
Hey... What could that be...?

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:24.780
An earthquake?

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:43.800
Here we go...! {Lala before punching the golem}

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:45.970
Yami-chan!

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:47.930
Turn back to your usual self, Yami-chan!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.480
You destroyed it without hesitation.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.480
Even though it had Yuuki Rito's appearance.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:01.110
Because it's not Rito!

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:07.660
That's true.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.340
T-This is too crazy...

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:21.630
Lala-san... Yami-chan!

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:23.800
Hey, we have to hurry up and follow!

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:27.300
But... maybe we should be getting our D-Dials first!

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:28.550
Oh, huh?

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:30.300
You two!

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:31.640
Are you hurt?

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:35.730
We're okay, but Yuuki-kun is...!

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:38.270
Hey, there's something unusual about Yami-chan!

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:39.940
What's going on?

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:43.230
There's nothing to worry about, Shameless-senpai.

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:47.530
Yami-oneechan is just having a strange dream.

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.240
We have to wake her up.

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:52.870
Lala-sama!

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:54.120
This is bad, this is bad!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.700
My all-purpose tool is...!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.500
I'm a little different from before!

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:08.470
W-What?

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:10.010
Peke, what's going on?!

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:13.510
T-There's a wormhole connected to the lining of your panties!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.940
Peke, temporarily dissolve only my panties!

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:20.270
Y-Yes!

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:24.860
Because now, I'm...

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.530
...shameless!

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:35.200
Peke! My clothes!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:39.040
My synthetic nano-machine fibres are being corroded!

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.880
Ah! No, stop!

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.510
Stop it, Yami!

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:50.380
That's a nice voice, Princess!

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.510
That wriggling is the best!

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.060
Hard-Hard-Freeze-Kun!

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:04.150
Slippery-Slippery-Slip-Kun!

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:05.440
Eh?

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:11.780
Rito!

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:12.910
Lala!

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:19.330
Mikan-chan, is it true that a fourth-grader also confessed to you?

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:21.370
Yeah. I turned him down, though.

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:23.330
As expected!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.880
You're a devilish girl who even bewitches younger boys!

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:28.090
You're so amazing, Mikan-chan!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:31.340
I'm not really bewitching anyone, though.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:33.390
What's that?

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:34.350
It's pretty!

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:45.980
I understand it clearly now, Princess Lala.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:48.610
You are an enemy to me, after all.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:52.780
I will kill Yuuki Rito and become one with his soul.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:55.700
You are an interloper trying to hinder me!

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:58.870
Lala-sama, that volume of energy is dangerous!

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.200
This might be our chance!

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:05.080
If Yami-chan exhausts her energy, she may return to normal!

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:11.340
Rito, can you stay just like that for a little bit?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:17.140
If I'm with you, I'm sure I can put out more than 100% energy!

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:20.600
There's no way I could recognise killing as a form of love.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.060
But that is mine!

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:38.280
Lala-sama, we're being pushed back!

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.540
Lala, are you okay?

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:48.960
Hm? Maron?

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:59.140
I-It's okay!

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:02.640
I'll protect you, and this city!

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:06.520
Just disappear, you interfering insect!

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.270
Please wake up, Yami-chan!

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:24.040
She countered my attack...?

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:31.300
Lala, are you okay-?!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.230
Sorry-

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:52.650
Wait, d-did you become smaller?!

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:57.280
It looks like I used a little too much power.

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.530
I-Is that so?

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:03.490
If they use too much power, their bodies become smaller.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:06.160
It's a phenomenon peculiar to Devilukeans.

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:08.290
Lala-sama, how could you be so reckless!?

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.130
Now that I think of it, Lala's old man was the same.

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:14.250
He was even smaller, though.

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:21.010
The current king of Deviluke went too far at the end of the great Galactic War and shrunk, if I remember correctly.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:24.060
But becoming a loli when you use too much power?

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.640
You Devilukeans are quite the fetishists. {Both of these lines are 100% legit and epic as fuck.}

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:28.690
Yami! You're still...!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:32.310
You won't be able to counter the next one in that condition, will you?

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:40.490
What's going on?

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:43.030
It seems she exhausted her power, as well.

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:46.540
But she didn't return to the original Yami-chan.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.540
Out of power?

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.000
Don't make me laugh.

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:54.210
I did use a bit of energy, but it will recharge soon.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:56.420
So long as I don't use any high power attacks,

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:59.220
my trans abilities will still work.

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:00.130
Peke!

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:00.930
Yes!

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.180
Huh?

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:07.220
Lala!

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:08.430
A-Are you okay?

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.020
My body is trembling.

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:12.980
This is a problem.

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:15.270
Oh, what a pity.

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:17.860
It looks like you really did squeeze out every last drop of power.

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:20.150
Then it'll be over this time, won't it?

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:24.200
W-Wait, Yami!

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:25.950
Your target is me, right?

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:26.580
Rito!

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:33.130
I can't let you do that, Golden Darkness!

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:38.260
Ugh, another interloper.

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:40.840
Maul! Bwats!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:44.010
I'm sorry for being late, Lala-sama!

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:49.180
We saw the pillar of light and rushed here, but I didn't think it would turn out to be something like this!

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:50.600
Zastin!

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.190
Wasn't today the deadline for a one-shot manga?

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:54.480
Lala-sama!

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:56.230
Such a thing doesn't matter right now!

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:58.570
Being a manga author is just a temporary occupation!

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:03.910
I have merely taken a little distance in accordance with the wishes of your sisters and you!

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.160
But the bottom line is,

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:08.700
we are the bodyguards of the Devilukean royal family!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.700
<b>Path of Manga</b>

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:15.580
Your shirt makes that extremely unconvincing.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:19.710
Even if geezers like you look at me in a perverted way, it will only feel gross.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:21.300
Ahh, geez!

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.720
Annoying! Such a pain!

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:25.970
It's plain to see that you're not yourself.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:29.930
But Golden Darkness...  someone hurting Lala-sama...

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:32.430
...is something I cannot overlook!

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:36.400
Ah! Wait, Zastin!

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:46.990
W-What is this?!

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.280
This is...!

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.240
You shouldn't fight.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:52.160
That’s right.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.120
Nana!

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:54.000
Momo!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:54.540
Eh...?

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.750
Geh! That tiny girl is big sister?!

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:58.460
Rito-senpai!

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.380
Mea!

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:00.630
I'm so glad!

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.550
You're still alive!

00:13:06.390 --> 00:13:09.010
Geez... As expected of you, Senpai!

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:10.890
S-Sorry!

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:13.180
You're doing that suddenly, you beast?!

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:16.190
I'm relieved to see that you seem well, Rito-san.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:17.520
Momo! Nana!

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:19.440
Where were you up till now?

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:23.030
It's a long story, so I'll leave it to your imagination.

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:24.190
Right now what's most important is...

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.700
Zastin-sama! That's...!

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:30.160
Golden Darkness's little sister, Mea!

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:32.540
Why, you! Are you-

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:36.460
Nana-sama, Momo-sama, could you please stop fooling around at a time like this?

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:38.710
We're not fooling around.

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:39.710
Yeah.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:42.210
Mea is our friend.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:43.800
And of course, Yami too.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:46.510
We didn't come here to fight.

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:48.890
We're here to return Yami-san to normal!

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:51.970
Lala-senpai.

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:52.560
Huh?

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:55.980
This is thanks to you, Lala-senpai.

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:59.060
Thank you for keeping Yami-oneechan busy until now.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:00.310
Mea-chan...

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:03.150
So long as this city and Rito-senpai are safe,

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.990
Yami-oneechan can return to normal!

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:07.700
Mea, is there a way to return Yami to normal?

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.160
Like Psycho Dive or something...?

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:10.120
No.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:14.750
The program planted inside Yami-oneechan has been activated,

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:16.960
so it's not like she's being controlled by some parasite.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:18.960
That can't be...

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:21.460
But... There's still hope.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:25.460
Didn't you disappear...?

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.050
This is strange.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:28.340
Are you the real thing?

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:30.430
That's right, Yami-oneechan!

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:35.680
What happened at the pool was part of Master's... no, Nemesis's plot!

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.930
I haven't gone anywhere!

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:39.060
I'm right here!

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:41.230
Onee-chan, you should return to normal, as well!

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:43.650
Stop trying to kill Rito-senpai!

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:47.070
<i>Stop trying to kill Rito...?</i>

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:48.450
I see.

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.660
So I guess you're an interloper as well, Mea.

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.120
Hand him over to Onee-chan.

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:59.870
Otherwise I'll do something naughty to you, too.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.750
I guess I don't have any choice.

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.290
This is the only way...

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:08.470
Mea!

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:20.270
Nana-chan, Momo-chan, I'll leave him to you.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:26.730
Does Mea intend to defeat Yami?

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.490
No, we have a plan!

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:31.320
A plan to return Yami-san back to normal!

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:33.530
It's...

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.160
Are you trying to oppose Onee-chan, Mea?

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:40.500
That's right.

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:44.500
The real Onee-chan would surely say it at a time like this.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.340
"Yuuki Rito is my target."

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:53.840
"I won't let anyone else kill him."

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:55.010
Is that so?

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:57.010
What Nemesis said...

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:03.150
That Darkness may have a bug in it.

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:05.270
I think so as well.

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:07.820
Darkness's obsession with perverted things,

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:10.490
and her attachment to Rito-senpai are not normal.

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:13.110
There's no mistake, it's Rito-senpai's influence.

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:19.540
The Darkness Program is supposed to overwrite her heart into that of a weapon, with the instinct to destroy.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:26.630
Which means the feelings for Rito-senpai inside Yami-oneechan's heart were the only thing it was unable to overwrite.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:30.130
Yami-oneechan's heart isn't gone yet!

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.630
The Darkness trans is incomplete!

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.640
I'm the cause of the bug...?

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:37.600
Yes.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.680
It still remains faintly in Yami-san's heart.

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:43.390
I think the reason why Yami-san sent Nana and I to Mea-san's apartment was also...

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:48.650
...because of the unconscious work of
Yami-san's heart, which cares for Mea-san.

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:52.320
Having taken that into account, Mea-san's plan is...

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:55.240
That light from before was incredible, wasn't it?

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:56.660
I wonder what it was...?

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:58.410
It didn't seem like lightning.

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:04.330
It could be that there are people fighting 
with the world at stake without us knowing! {lol, that Dragonball reference}

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.290
Mami, you've been reading too much manga!

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:09.710
A fight with the world at stake, huh?

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:13.760
I wonder how many people can I think of that would be able to do that...?

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:17.470
You're okay right, Yami-san?

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.800
W-Wha-?!

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:22.350
I-I have to do something like that?

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:25.480
And if I do that, Yami will return to normal? Really?

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.060
I don't know.

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:29.230
It's all nothing more than conjecture.

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:33.240
We might be able to get proof using Psycho Dive,

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.400
but it looks like we can't do that, either.

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:39.990
There's a risk that the Darkness Program may attack Mea-san's heart, as well.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:45.790
We have no choice left but to gamble on Yami-san's heart with you, Rito-san!

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:49.750
To be honest, I thought it sounded like a foolish plan, as well.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:54.510
But Mea, who is more well-versed about hearts than us, says there's hope.

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:59.590
Mea is fighting to the very limit to whittle her power down.

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:02.010
For the sake of reducing the danger to you, if only a little, Rito.

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:05.600
I want to believe in Mea's hope, as well!

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:10.110
I'll do it!

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:14.070
If there's even a slight possibility that I can return Yami to normal, then...!

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.700
Nana! Momo!

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:17.570
What is this...?

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:22.450
It's a costume changing core that lets you change your outfit just by wearing it.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:25.290
I've already entered your measurement data!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:26.410
Big sister...!

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:29.040
Make sure you protect Rito properly!

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:30.330
It'll be okay!

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:33.500
I'm sure Rito will be able to meet our expectations!

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:40.010
Yeah!

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:42.640
Please wait, Nana-sama, Momo-sama!

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:46.640
I cannot allow you to do something so dangerous!

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:51.100
We'll leave Onee-sama to you and the others, Zastin-san.

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:55.150
After another five minutes, they'll return to the digital safari.

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:58.400
I'll give it my best!

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.820
Yeah!

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:05.700
As expected of Onee-chan.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:07.830
The precision of her trans hasn't dropped one bit.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:10.370
Despite the fact that in the conflict with Lala-senpai,

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:14.460
she should have consumed enough energy to
destroy the planet two or three times over...

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:18.550
But... Infinite power is impossible!

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:22.300
There should be meaning in fighting her like this!

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:26.510
That's a nice expression you're making, Mea!

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:31.520
If I see an expression like that... it makes me want to gobble you up!

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:40.990
Lick, lick, lick...

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.360
Ah! Hey-!

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:47.740
You're always telling Yuuki Rito to lick you, right?

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:50.750
But it seems it's difficult for him.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:55.460
He has the ability to be shameless,

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:59.300
but he is a person who cannot do perverted things of his own will.

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:02.760
So Onee-chan will do it in his stead for you.

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:09.390
This isn't amazing at all.

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:20.280
Onee-chan, there was a time when I was licked by the real Rito-senpai while using Psycho Jack.

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:24.110
Compared to the chills I felt then, something like this is...

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:26.910
Oh?

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:29.290
Well then, show me how long you can endure this!

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:50.220
T-This is bad..!

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:53.690
Onee-chan is too amazing!

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:57.560
I'll kill you at the moment you climax!

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:00.150
I wonder how much longer you can hold out for?

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:09.990
A beanstalk...?

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:13.000
They came...

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:26.590
Ri... Rito-senpai!

00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:36.310
Eh, Yuuki Rito!

00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:39.110
Did you come all this way to be killed by me?

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:42.360
N-No! That's wrong!

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:46.240
I came here to let loose and do lots of perverted things to you!

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:51.080
I'll show you my true nature right now!

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:55.000
Prepare yourself!

